<td tEditID="c1r2" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r2" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<p class="paragraph" style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0in; vertical-align: baseline;"><span class="normaltextrun"><span style="font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">Hi&nbsp;</span></span><span style="font-size: 12pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 102);">[Insert Name]</span><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;">,</span></p>

<p class="paragraph" style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0in; vertical-align: baseline;"><span class="eop"><span style="font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></span><span style="font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class="paragraph" style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0in; vertical-align: baseline;"><span class="normaltextrun"><span style="font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">I
wanted to share the new College Red Cord recognition program for college
students to honor and thank them for helping to save lives!</span></span><span class="eop"><span style="font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></span><span style="font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class="paragraph" style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0in; vertical-align: baseline;"><span class="eop"><span style="font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></span><span style="font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><o:p></o:p></span></p>

<ul style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; margin-top: 0in;" type="disc">
 <li class="paragraph" style="margin-top:0in;margin-bottom:0in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;
     vertical-align:baseline"><span class="normaltextrun"><b><span style="font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">What:</span></b></span><span class="normaltextrun"><span style="font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">
     </span></span><span style="font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">Each
     qualifying college student Blood Program Leader hosting at least one drive
     during the program timeframe, and collects a minimum of 25 units, will be
     awarded a Red Cross Graduation Cord.</span>&nbsp;</li></ul>

<ul style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; margin-top: 0in;" type="disc">
 <li class="paragraph" style="margin-top:0in;margin-bottom:0in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;
     vertical-align:baseline"><span class="normaltextrun"><b><span style="font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">When:</span></b></span><span class="normaltextrun"><span style="font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">
     July 1 – June 30</span></span>&nbsp;</li></ul>

<ul style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; margin-top: 0in;" type="disc">
 <li class="paragraph" style="margin-top:0in;margin-bottom:0in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;
     vertical-align:baseline"><span class="normaltextrun"><b><span style="font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">Why:</span></b></span><span class="normaltextrun"><span style="font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">
     </span></span><span style="font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">This
     gift is intended to serve as recognition for the student’s commitment to
     our mission and encouragement to continue partnering with the Red Cross
     and help save more lives.</span><o:p></o:p></li>
</ul>

<p class="paragraph" style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0in; background: white; vertical-align: baseline;"><span class="eop"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">&nbsp;</span><o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class="paragraph" style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0in; background: white; vertical-align: baseline;"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">Please tell your student BPLs and higher education colleagues about
this exciting opportunity — feel free to customize and share the attached email
template. We want to show our gratitude for all the students going above and
beyond to ensure patients receive the blood they need!</span><o:p></o:p></p>

<p class="paragraph" style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0in; background: white; vertical-align: baseline;"><span class="normaltextrun">&nbsp;</span></p>

<p class="paragraph" style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0in; background: white; vertical-align: baseline;"><span class="normaltextrun"><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">Feel free to contact me with any
questions. Thank you for your continued support of our lifesaving mission!</span></span><o:p></o:p></p>

<p class="paragraph" style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; margin: 0in; vertical-align: baseline;"><span class="eop"><span style="font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></span><span style="font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><o:p></o:p></span></p>

<span class="normaltextrun" style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;
mso-fareast-font-family:Calibri;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-ansi-language:
EN-US;mso-fareast-language:EN-US;mso-bidi-language:AR-SA">Sincerely,</span></span><div style=""><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 102); font-size: 12pt;">[Insert Name]</span></div><div style=""><div style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div></div>]]></td>
</tr>
